infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Closed-loop vs open-loop load testing
  desc Same service at 5,000 rps — coordinated omission hides the tail by 10-100x
  compares
    - label Closed-loop (coordinated omission)
      children
        - label Fixed pool of virtual users
          desc Each waits for a response before the next request
        - label Arrivals drop during stalls
          desc Stops sending exactly when latency is worst
        - label Records mostly the good times
          desc Histogram omits the worst seconds
        - label Reported p99: 31 ms
          desc Looks safe — ships to production
    - label Open-loop (honest clock)
      children
        - label Fixed arrival rate
          desc Fires on schedule regardless of responses (wrk2, vegeta)
        - label Stall time enters the histogram
          desc Requests queue and record full waiting time
        - label Tail has nowhere to hide
          desc 10-100x higher p99 than the closed loop
        - label Reported p99: 2.1 s
          desc Matches what users actually feel
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
